<p>Hey there! I'm really glad you like the idea. I should point out that the K-class scenario is a <em>claim</em> of the SCP, not something we know will happen. The Foundation points out that the scenario as described doesn't match anything they know about and the details the SCP provides are scarce, reinforcing the idea that the SCP's mind could be somewhat confused by the number of memories it holds.</p>

